---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About — Carlos García">
  <section class="section-spacing">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="mb-12 reveal">
        <p class="font-mono text-sm text-accent mb-2">About</p>
        <h1 class="text-display font-heading text-text-primary">Carlos García</h1>
      </div>

      <div class="max-w-2xl mb-16">
        <div class="space-y-6 text-text-secondary leading-relaxed reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <p>
            I'm a software developer focused on backend engineering, clean architecture and DevOps.
            I design and build systems that are scalable, maintainable and modular.
          </p>
          <p>
            My work spans the full path from code to production: writing backend services with
            clear architecture, containerizing with Docker, automating infrastructure with Ansible,
            and deploying with CI/CD pipelines that include health checks and rollback.
          </p>
          <p>
            I believe the interesting engineering problems aren't in the code itself — they're
            in how systems connect, how failures are handled, and how deployments stay reliable
            when things go wrong.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-headline font-heading text-text-primary mb-6 reveal">What I focus on</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="card-surface p-5 reveal reveal-delay-1">
            <h3 class="font-heading font-semibold text-text-primary text-sm mb-2">Backend Architecture</h3>
            <p class="text-text-muted text-xs leading-relaxed">
              Clean architecture, separation of concerns, testable business logic. I've worked with
              Onion Architecture, middleware pipelines, and dependency injection.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="card-surface p-5 reveal reveal-delay-2">
            <h3 class="font-heading font-semibold text-text-primary text-sm mb-2">DevOps & Automation</h3>
            <p class="text-text-muted text-xs leading-relaxed">
              Docker, Ansible, CI/CD pipelines, Blue/Green deployments. I automate the path from
              code commit to production.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="card-surface p-5 reveal reveal-delay-3">
            <h3 class="font-heading font-semibold text-text-primary text-sm mb-2">Testing</h3>
            <p class="text-text-muted text-xs leading-relaxed">
              Automated tests as a design tool. I've written 1000+ tests covering use cases,
              entities, validators and controllers.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="card-surface p-5 reveal reveal-delay-4">
            <h3 class="font-heading font-semibold text-text-primary text-sm mb-2">Resilience</h3>
            <p class="text-text-muted text-xs leading-relaxed">
              Circuit breakers, fallback chains, health checks, auto-recovery. Systems that stay
              online when external dependencies fail.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-headline font-heading text-text-primary mb-6 reveal">Current focus</h2>
        <div class="card-surface p-6 reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-text-secondary text-sm">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-accent mt-0.5">→</span>
              <span>Building backend systems with clear architecture</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-accent mt-0.5">→</span>
              <span>Automating deployment pipelines with CI/CD</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-accent mt-0.5">→</span>
              <span>Improving system reliability and failure handling</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 reveal">
        <a
          href="https://github.com/carlosgarcia-tech"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 bg-accent text-white font-medium rounded-md hover:bg-accent-muted transition-colors duration-150"
        >
          GitHub Profile
        </a>
        <a
          href="mailto:contact@carlosgarcia.dev"
          class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 border border-surface-border text-text-secondary font-medium rounded-md hover:border-text-muted hover:text-text-primary transition-colors duration-150"
        >
          Get in Touch
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
